textures), but that is an extremely niche use case, so I don't think it's necessary anymore","created_at":"2026-06-05T16:58:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T16:58:33Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120031#discussion_r3364140130","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120031","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3364140130"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120031#discussion_r3364140130"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120031"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3364140130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":322,"original_line":319,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3364009393,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":33,"position":27,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3394918139","pull_request_review_id":4475618654,"id":3394918139,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7KWlb7","diff_hunk":"@@ -301,15 +301,12 @@ Ref<Image> basis_universal_unpacker_ptr(const uint8_t *p_data, int p_size) {\n \n \tswitch (decompress_format) {\n \t\tcase BASIS_DECOMPRESS_R: {\n-\t\t\tif (rgtc_supported) {\n-\t\t\t\tbasisu_format = basist::transcoder_texture_format::cTFBC4_R;\n-\t\t\t\timage_format = Image::FORMAT_RGTC_R;\n-\t\t\t} else if (s3tc_supported) {\n-\t\t\t\tbasisu_format = basist::transcoder_texture_format::cTFBC1;\n-\t\t\t\timage_format = Image::FORMAT_DXT1;","path":"modules/basis_universal/image_compress_basisu.cpp","commit_id":"bc66e91098e08801195b194e0df9ac0558e93fe5","original_commit_id":"95c6a9469c90a16338202d984166e38e5dbd87b4","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is a comparison of how the DXT1 fallback looks like compared to BC4:\r\n| DXT1 | BC4 |\r\n|-------|------|\r\n| <img width=\"1428\" height=\"1428\" alt=\"s3tc\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22431af9-ff0c-44ff-b90d-ed8c6767042c\" /> | <img width=\"1428\" height=\"1429\" alt=\"rgtc\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ddf426e6-7928-4ac0-9ee2-30159bf0eb93\" /> |\r\n\r\nWhen it comes to devices that don't support BC4, the results are as follows:\r\n| Format | [Vulkan](https://vulkan.gpuinfo.org/listoptimaltilingformats.php) | [OpenGL (Desktop)](https://opengl.gpuinfo.org/listextensions.php) | [OpenGL ES](https://opengles.gpuinfo.org/listextensions.php) |\r\n|----------|-------|-----------|--------|\r\n| DXT1 | 56.58% | 98.02% | 5.17% |\r\n| BC4 | 55.67% | 86.28% | 3.2% |\r\n\r\nIn terms of Vulkan, the difference is less than 1% and probably includes some mobile devices for which we use ETC2 anyway. With OpenGL however, the difference is ~12%. Though this takes into account OpenGL 1 and 2 -only devices, which have a higher chance of only supporting S3TC.\r\n\r\nFor the record I could still keep the DXT1 fallback if it's deemed necessary, the only reason for its removal was the discussion in #120000","created_at":"2026-06-11T09:52:12Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T09:52:12Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120031#discussion_r3394918139","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120031","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3394918139"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120031#discussion_r3394918139"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120031"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3394918139/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":307,"original_start_line":307,"start_side":"LEFT","line":309,"original_line":309,"side":"LEFT","in_reply_to_id":3364000177,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":9,"position":13,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3397366956","pull_request_review_id":4478454006,"id":3397366956,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7Kf7Ss","diff_hunk":"@@ -301,15 +301,12 @@ Ref<Image> basis_universal_unpacker_ptr(const uint8_t *p_data, int p_size) {\n \n \tswitch (decompress_format) {\n \t\tcase BASIS_DECOMPRESS_R: {\n-\t\t\tif (rgtc_supported) {\n-\t\t\t\tbasisu_format = basist::transcoder_texture_format::cTFBC4_R;\n-\t\t\t\timage_format = Image::FORMAT_RGTC_R;\n-\t\t\t} else if (s3tc_supported) {\n-\t\t\t\tbasisu_format = basist::transcoder_texture_format::cTFBC1;\n-\t\t\t\timage_format = Image::FORMAT_DXT1;","path":"modules/basis_universal/image_compress_basisu.cpp","commit_id":"bc66e91098e08801195b194e0df9ac0558e93fe5","original_commit_id":"95c6a9469c90a16338202d984166e38e5dbd87b4","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubu